		{
			dependencies: ["45752C40878A1689"]
			description: [
				"Combining an &6Active Prismatic Core&r with some &6Transcendental Matrix&r and &6Activated Netherite&r will grant you &6Infinity Ingots&r. Infinity is the primary component of &aUEV&6 Hulls&r, but has many other uses throughout the end-game."
				""
				"Instead of turning your Prismatic Cores into Infinity, you can instead convert them into &6Liquid Null&r. As the embodiment of sheer nothing-ness, it makes for a great cable coating sheet! And thus, it will be required for all &aUEV&r+ cables. Note that the amount of Null you get is far greater the more you process your Cores."
			]
			id: "4EA1E0D437528747"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.25d
			subtitle: "I bet we could make hulls out of these."
