		{
			dependencies: ["33F610CF136278AE"]
			description: [
				"Using a Shattered Microverse and a &6Tier Eleven Microminer&r, &6Alien Scrap&r can be retrieved. Scrap can be sifted into various bits of ruined tech, each of which go through their own miniature processing line to be recycled into &6Necrosiderite&r."
				""
				"Scrap processing can also yield a variety of other important elements."
				""
				"&6Ruined Hulls&r are more abundant than &6Ruined Machine Parts&r but give less &6Necrosiderite&r overall. They also give high-end materials such as &6Neutronium&r, &6Tritanium&r, and &6Crystal Matrix&r"
