		{
			dependencies: ["15607184B546F5EE"]
			description: [
				"&9Eltz&r is made by processing &6Impure Eltic&r gems or dust in an Electric Blast Furnace, which in turn are created from &6Eltic Sludge Dust&r via an in-world crystallization process."
				""
				"Unfortunately, &6Eltic Sludge Dust&r is made through a long process which consumes large quantities of aluminosilicate dusts and &6Hydrofluoric Acid&r to make enough &6Dirty Hexafluorosilicic Solution&r."
				""
				"Hopefully, you've stockpiled a ton of these dusts since they don't have much use otherwise. &eIf not, you can get more by centrifuging some types of rock dusts or mining the corresponding ores.&r"
