			description: [
				"&6Actinium&r is a radioactive material, and can be obtained by bombarding &6Uranic Solution&r or &6Radon Salt&r with neutrons from a &6Neutron Emitter&r, having a chance of creating Actinium."
				""
				"Keep in mind, though, that over time, the emitter will &edegrade&r, so keeping spares is important."
				""
				"Actinium is the base material for the &4UHV&r components, so prepare to make a lot of it."
