		{
			dependencies: ["38B1588655AA9BDF"]
			description: [
				"When a &3Shattered Microverse&r runs out of integrity, it becomes a &3Corrupted Microverse&r."
				""
				"Corrupted Microverses decay passively, even when a recipe is running."
				""
				"Corrupted microverses can be repaired with &6Quantum Flux&r, however be careful to not overfeed it. Flux can now be consumed even when less than 1%% of Integrity is missing, and when it does so the recipe progress regresses."
