				"The final assembler. You will need &6Optical Mainframes&r, &6Sculk Bioalloy&r, &6Necrosiderite&r, &6Darconite&r, &6Infinity&r, and &6Null&r to make this."
				""
				"With this you can make &aUEV &6Energy Hatches&r, unlocking the &3Dimensonal Superassembler&r and &3Transdimensional Energy Singularity&r, two incredibly powerful multiblock machines that will transform how you structure your factory."
