		{
			dependencies: ["3E45F67F09B6156B"]
			description: [
				"Pure Radiation Inhibiting Spectral Medium Glass, also known as &6P.R.I.S.M Glass&r, is the final tier of Glass available. It catches high energy radiation passing through and slows it down to visible light, seen as streaks of color. It will be used in a few multiblock structures and various &aUEV&r singleblocks."
				""
				"This will be the first automation challenge you'll face with the &3Prismatic Crucible&r. While it is possible to make all your P.R.I.S.M by using a single Crucible and countless &6Chromatic Stabilizers&r, consider exploring alternate, cheaper sequences processing the Glass midproducts out of order, or using multiple Crucibles alongside each other."
			]
			id: "415F2703877FBE21"
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "So Sparkly!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2DCCBC8B49276284"
