		{
			dependencies: [
				"060A5766B021FC77"
				"1C861E0C62D5B97D"
			]
			description: ["Imagine if we could sandwich all of the strongest Microminer platings together between some &6Monium&r and &6Eltz&r, creating something truly impossible and incredible. \n\n&9If only we had the knowledge to be able to assemble something like that...&r"]
