		{
			dependencies: [
				"060A5766B021FC77"
				"5601A05D8361551D"
			]
			description: [
				"With &6Monium&r and &6Extradimensional Mainframes&r, you can make &cMAX&r &6Energy Hatches&r. A 16A &cMAX&r hatch provides 256x the power compared to a &aUEV&r one, if you can supply it."
				""
				"These hatches, along with the &3Transdimensional Energy Singularity&r and &6Omega Parallel Hatches&r, will allow you to scale your infrastructure to the insane levels needed to beat the pack.\n&2The &6Creative Quantum Chest&2 costs over &ltwo hundred&r &6Extradimensional Processor Mainframes&2 and &lfive thousand&r &6Monium Ingots&2. You &lwill&r&2 need to use &6MAX hatches&2.&r"
			]
			id: "4F08AF2C1E6B1736"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{
				id: "2C8C638FEC727E22"
